   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formation",
     "texto": [
      "It is formed with **être** (in whatever tense you need) + past participle. The participle **agrees with the subject**: **Le gâteau est fait** (the cake is made), **La lettre est écrite** (the letter is written).",
      "Compare with English: «est fait» and «fut écrit» work the same way in French."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Watch out",
     "texto": [
      "With **être** the participle changes form: masculine or feminine and singular or plural: **écrit**, **écrite**, **écrits**, **écrites**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
